1
00:00:03,637 --> 00:00:05,917
(Amy:)Should you really be
sitting in Sheldon's spot?

2
00:00:06,073 --> 00:00:07,883
(Raj:)He's in Texas.
He'll never know.

3
00:00:08,041 --> 00:00:09,311
(Penny:)I wouldn't be so sure about that.

4
00:00:09,476 --> 00:00:11,356
(Leonard:)Yeah, he has a very sensitive butt.

5
00:00:14,248 --> 00:00:15,248
(Leonard:)Well, it's true.

6
00:00:15,415 --> 00:00:18,055
(Leonard:)Once I saw him sit on a bunch
of loose change and add it up.

7
00:00:20,587 --> 00:00:21,587
(Raj:)Have you heard from Howard?

8
00:00:21,755 --> 00:00:23,255
(Bernadette:)I did.
His talk at NASA went great.

9
00:00:23,423 --> 00:00:24,663
(Penny:)Sheldon didn't heckle him?

10
00:00:24,825 --> 00:00:26,235
(Bernadette:)No, in fact, he was so well-behaved,

11
00:00:26,393 --> 00:00:29,433
(Bernadette:)Howie bought him a Buzz Aldrin
bobble head and astronaut ice cream.

12
00:00:31,598 --> 00:00:33,438
(Stuart:)-Hey, guys.
-Hi, Stewart.

13
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:34,940
(Stuart:)-How's it going?
-Good .

14
00:00:35,102 --> 00:00:37,772
(Raj:)Sheldon's out of town,
so we can do whatever we want.

15
00:00:37,938 --> 00:00:39,848
(Raj:)We even ordered from
the Thai place he doesn't like.

16
00:00:40,007 --> 00:00:41,007
(Stuart:)How is it?

17
00:00:41,174 --> 00:00:42,714
(Penny:)Disgusting. Do not tell him.

18
00:00:44,278 --> 00:00:45,448
(Leonard:)What do you guys want to do tonight?

19
00:00:45,612 --> 00:00:46,782
(Amy:)I don't know.

20
00:00:46,947 --> 00:00:49,587
(Bernadette:)I told Howie if I wasn't busy,
I'd spend the night at his mom's.

21
00:00:49,750 --> 00:00:51,630
(Bernadette:)So for God's sake,
think of something.

22
00:00:55,556 --> 00:00:57,036
(Raj:)Stuart? Are you okay?

23
00:00:57,190 --> 00:00:58,790
(Stuart:)No, I don't feel so...

24
00:01:00,027 --> 00:01:01,197
-Oh, Stuart?
-Stuart?

25
00:01:01,361 --> 00:01:03,141
(Leonard:)Oh, my God,
you guys need to do something!

26
00:01:03,297 --> 00:01:04,637
(Leonard:)Calling 911.

27
00:01:04,798 --> 00:01:07,468
(Raj:)-It's too late.
-What do you mean it's too late?

28
00:01:07,634 --> 00:01:10,474
(Raj:)He's been murdered
by someone in this room.

29
00:01:10,571 --> 00:01:11,881
I (DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYS)

30
00:01:12,039 --> 00:01:14,149
(Leonard:)-Oh, my God.
-Come on!

31
00:01:14,641 --> 00:01:18,141
(Raj:)Welcome to another classic
Koothrappali murder mystery dinner.

32
00:01:19,813 --> 00:01:21,153
(Amy:)I'm leaving.

33
00:01:21,949 --> 00:01:22,949
(Raj:)You can't leave.

34
00:01:23,116 --> 00:01:26,996
(Raj:)You're a suspect in the
mysterious murder of Stuart Bloom.

35
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:28,720
I (DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYS)

36
00:01:30,257 --> 00:01:31,497
(Bernadette:)I didn't know his
last name was Bloom.

37
00:01:31,658 --> 00:01:32,798
(Amy:)Yeah, it's Bloom.

38
00:01:33,994 --> 00:01:35,164
(Penny:)Are you really gonna
lie on the floor

39
00:01:35,329 --> 00:01:36,499
(Penny:)and pretend to be dead all night?

40
00:01:36,663 --> 00:01:40,023
(Stuart:)What do you think
I was gonna do at home?

